  "description": "In the complex world of gears and gadgets you can still find simplicity. Shoreliner sports a high-quality Shimano Nexus 3 speed hub with a twist shifter to match, decision making doesn't get much easier than low, medium, and high when you are negotiating rolling terrain. Add in Del Sol's Pedal-Forward 6000 series aluminum SuperCruise frame with a Step-Thru option, an oversized Del Sol springer saddle, swept back bars and grips, and coordinated full fenders and chainguard and you are ready to roll in the ultimate combination of comfort and style.\n6061 Alloy SuperCruise Pedal-Forward design frame with laid-back geometry for comfort and lower seat height\nForged Alloy 3 Piece crank, 42t\nRust-free alloy 27.2mm X 350mm seat post\nLightweight, rust-free alloy rims with stainless steel 14g spokes\nShimano Nexus 3-spd rear hub\nFull-Coverage Fenders",
